  "invariants": [
    "Source absolute coordinates never change during rebase.",
    "Stable spatial IDs and owners never change during rebase.",
    "East maps to +Godot X, north to -Godot Z, and up to +Godot Y.",
    "The transform and inverse round-trip within the configured numeric tolerance.",
